-- Adds light Markdown formatting to the "ssc-english-bank" (100
-- questions) answers — same treatment as Railway, Teaching, GK, Police,
-- and Banking: short, factual grammar/vocabulary answers, so the key
-- fact (the defined term, the example word, the rule) is bolded per
-- answer. This set's answers very often already quote the key word with
-- double quotes (e.g. "ornithologist"), which this migration preserves
-- and bolds in place, rather than inserting paragraph breaks.

